description=Fixes notification shade frame drops on Galaxy Tab S7 (T870) running MinsOS One UI 8.5/Android 16. Locks solid 120Hz, relaxes SurfaceFlinger VSYNC offset, enables native GPU Kawase blur, and accelerates CPU Schedutil ramp-up.
